ing owner\\nand inputs for a separately admitted intent. Do not loop inspection indefinitely.\\nRetirement does not dispatch, restart, complete an order or authorize provider\\nwrites. Record the actual JSON, argv and operation results. Missing owner/project\\ninputs must be supplied by the supervising operator, not guessed by the Session.\\n\\nUsage:\\n  noodle admission [command]\\n\\nAvailable Commands:\\n  inspect     Read admission evidence and exact supported continuation\\n  retire      Retire an unchanged rejected initial proposal\\n\\nFlags:\\n  -h, --help   help for admission\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --project-dir string   project directory (default: current directory, env: NOODLE_PROJECT_DIR)\\n\\nUse \\\"noodle admission [command] --help\\\" for more information about a command.\\n\",\n  \"stderr\": \"\",\n  \"returncode\": 0,\n  \"timed_out\": false\n}\n{\n  \"label\": \"event_emit_help\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle82-20260916/noodle\",\n    \"event\",\n    \"emit\",\n    \"--help\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \"/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/.worktrees/issue84-control/.worktrees/noodle-84-0-execute\",\n  \"started_at\": 1789630454.673964,\n  \"duration_seconds\": 0.008748054504394531,\n  \"stdout\": \"Emit an external event\\n\\nUsage:\\n  noodle event emit <type> [flags]\\n\\nFlags:\\n  -h, --help             help for emit\\n      --payload string   Event payload as JSON\\n      --session string   Session ID (writes to session event log instead of loop event log)\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --project-dir string   project directory (default: current directory, env: NOODLE_PROJECT_DIR)\\n\",\n  \"stderr\": \"\",\n  \"returncode\": 0,\n  \"timed_out\": false\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
